  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Wear on",
   "texto": [
    "«Wear on» is **indossare**: **Indosso una giacca** (I wear a jacket). It also says **portare**.",
    "The colors match the garment: **un cappotto nero**, **una giacca nera**, **le scarpe nere**. Remember that **blu** never changes.",
    "To choose: **Mi piace questo** (I like this), **Preferisco quello** (I prefer that)."
